      en: ["Birthplace of Leif Erikson, born around 970 AD.", "The original longhouse covered approximately 50 square meters of floor space.", "Major archaeological excavations took place in 1997 and 1998.", "The reconstruction was completed in 2000 to mark the millennium of the discovery of Vinland.", "Erik the Red lived here until he was outlawed from the district for manslaughter.", "Traditional turf-building techniques were used to recreate the 10th-century structure."],
