      en: ["An Augustinian monastery was established on the island in 1225.", "Viðeyjarstofa was built in 1755 as the first stone building in Iceland.", "The island's church was consecrated in 1774 and is remarkably well-preserved.", "Skúli Magnússon, the founder of modern Reykjavík, is buried beneath the church.", "The Imagine Peace Tower was unveiled by Yoko Ono in 2007.", "The island was a thriving community with its own school until the mid-20th century."],
